  "implemented": [
    "Explicit tenant/venue source routing policy with scoped foreign keys, revision guard, default disabled and human configuration audit.",
    "Admin read/configure route; enabling checks explicit autonomous Content preparation authority and configured provider/model. No task or provider starts from configuration.",
    "System task constructor reuses canonical assignment/binding/messages/audit with SYSTEM provenance and required trusted admission before replay. Existing human API still rejects SYSTEM actor input."
  ],
  "nativeProof": [
    "Concurrent policy create yields one success and one revision conflict; default disabled; wrong scoped identity denied; explicit enable increments revision and audit.",
    "Exact policy admits system task create/replay; SYSTEM prompt/run/audit retained; stale policy denied before replay; deliberate outer failure rolls back task.",
    "Existing registered source/question/HTTP restart/amendment and explicit reviewed candidate chain still passes."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Automatic extraction-to-source outbox creation and scheduler reconciliation are NOT implemented yet. Policy and system constructor are prerequisites, not automatic dispatch.",
    "Source task admission callback is internal trusted code; future caller must validate exact durable dispatch and routing decision, never accept transport callbacks.",
    "No live routing configuration or provider invocation performed. New migration applied only to disposable PostgreSQL.",
    "Original128/32QA/A-B-C and provider/device/external/release gates remain separate; broad handoff refresh deferred."
  ],
  "testMaintenance": "Tenant table expected-list fixture was stale for two already-existing CharacterCandidateReview models; added those plus the new routing model without weakening runtime tenant isolation."
